353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Many young people face challenges in managing their finances and, mainly through poor financial decisions, have high levels of debt and incurred missed opportunities for wealth creation. This forum is designed to equip them with practical financial skills that they can apply to their daily lives, ensuring a foundation for long-term financial success. Through engaging discussions, expert-led workshops, product demonstrations and sensitisation, and networking opportunities, we aim to foster a culture of financial responsibility and independence among university students, particularly those in technical fields such as engineering.)
/E (Many young people face challenges in managing their finances and, mainly through poor financial decisions, have high levels of debt and incurred missed opportunities for wealth creation. This forum is designed to equip them with practical financial skills that they can apply to their daily lives, ensuring a foundation for long-term financial success. Through engaging discussions, expert-led workshops, product demonstrations and sensitisation, and networking opportunities, we aim to foster a culture of financial responsibility and independence among university students, particularly those in technical fields such as engineering.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
